# Properties on a frozen layer (not the current one, which loading unfreezes):
# a click must not open the dialog, a Shift-click must (Development Issues #75).
# The first PARAMCHECK has to report that there is no dialog.
VERSION 13
DEMOINIT
ORIG 0.000 0.000 0.000
ROOMSIZE 40.000 x 20.000
SCALE HO
LAYERS 0 1 0 1 255 0 0 0 0 "Main" 0 0 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000
LAYERS 1 1 1 1 255 0 0 0 0 "Frozen" 0 0 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000
LAYERS CURRENT 0
SENSOR 1 1 HO 2 5.000000 5.000000 "S1" "s1-script"
REDRAW
COMMAND Describe
MOUSE 2 5.000 5.000
MOUSE 4 5.000 5.000
PARAMCHECK Describe Sensor 1 S1
RESET
KEYSTATE 2
COMMAND Describe
MOUSE 2 5.000 5.000
MOUSE 4 5.000 5.000
KEYSTATE 0
PARAMCHECK Describe Sensor 4 s1-script
